        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions AP-SNJ1021SBR Classic Ornate Scroll Refrigerator Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe classic Scroll design is one of the all time favorite door pulls from First Impressions International. This beautiful ornate design adds class to any door. The San Juan Scroll Appliance Pull comes packaged with mounting screws for a refrigerator / appliance door panel. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/s-scroll-decorative-door-pull-first-impressions-snj1021sbr\"><b>First Impressions SNJ1021SBR Scroll Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<table width=\"600\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"text\" valign=\"center\"><b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions AP-SNJ01 Appliance Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 21-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 20-1/2\" C/C</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Mounting: Standard 3/4\" Thru-Bolts</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-SNJ01-specifcations.pdf?v=1704262217\"><b>First Impressions AP-SNJ1021SBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPictured to the right are a pair the Scroll Refrigerator Door Pulls mounted on a side by side Sub Zero Refrigerator.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPictured below is the SNJ1021SBR Appliance Pull in Oil Rubbed Bronze finish.\r\n</p>\r\n</td>\r\n\r\n<td rowspan=\"2\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/cf36a-fridge-pulls.jpg?v=1704354765\" border=\"0\" width=\"300\" height=\"484\"  alt=\"Sub Zero Refrigerator Door Pulls\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n\r\n<tr>\r\n<td valign=\"bottom\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/36a-fridge-pulls.jpg?v=1704354766\" border=\"0\" width=\"300\" height=\"250\"  alt=\"cf36 a pulls for Sub Zero Refrigerator \">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This Scroll Pull is handmade in the USA when you order it. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull).</i>\r\n</p>",
